		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Thirty-foot long, six-legged, wingless lightning drake. Territorial, envies dragons.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 15, <strong>HP</strong> 28, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 bite +5 (2d6) and 1 constrict or 1 lightning breath, <strong>MV</strong> double near, <strong>S</strong> +4, <strong>D</strong> +2, <strong>C</strong> +1, <strong>I</strong> -3, <strong>W</strong> +1, <strong>Ch</strong> -3, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 6</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Constrict</strong>. Contested STR to hold target immobile for one round.</p><p></p><p><strong>Lightning Breath</strong>. A straight line (5' wide) extending double near from behir. DEX 15+ or 3d6 damage (DISADV on check if wearing metal armor).</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
